le, ACO/MSSP; Medicaid: joint federal-state program, FMAP, managed care, § 1115 waivers, § 1915 HCBS waivers; EMTALA: dedicated ED, appropriate medical screening, stabilization duty, transfer requirements, private right of action; Stark Law: self-referral prohibition, financial relationships, in-office ancillary exception; Anti-Kickback Statute: intent-based, safe harbors, exclusion, FCA exposure)",
