50–200 m/day; biological pump: carbon flux from surface to benthos, efficiency, respiration losses en route; benthic food web: deposit feeders, filter feeders, scavengers, chemosynthetic subsidies; hadal food web: wood falls, whale falls as episodic organic enrichment — succession stages; whale fall ecology: mobile scavenger stage, enrichment opportunist stage, sulfophilic stage — parallel to vents)",
