tal shelf — natural prolongation or 200 nm; high seas — freedom of navigation and overflight, no territorial claim; ITLOS, Annex VII arbitration; climate change and sea-level rise: sinking states, baselines, statehood)",
            successCriteria: "International law study session completed (VCLT treaty interpretation method applied to a sample article, state responsibility attribution test (Article 4 vs Article 8) distinguished with Nicaragua example, jus cogens vs ordinary treaty norm distinction explained, UNCLOS EEZ rights vs high seas freedoms contrasted, and exam notes saved)",
