ntify circumstances precluding wrongfulness — if invoking necessity under Article 25: essential state interest, only means available, no serious impairment of another obligation, state not contributed to the situation; calculate reparation owed — restitution in kind first, then compensation for financially assessable damage, then satisfaction)",
