ent evidence and current speculation; assess displacement: compare cohort turnover rates; interview secondary sources or literature if direct interviews are not feasible; evaluate policy response: any anti-displacement programs implemented; draw conclusion on whether gentrification benefited existing residents or primarily benefited newcomers and investors)",
