rtunity costs; identify all benefits: reduced health damages (VSL-based), recreational value (travel cost), existence value (CV study); apply discount rate — state social discount rate chosen and justify; compute NPV = Σ (Bt − Ct)/(1+r)^t; compute BCR; perform sensitivity analysis on discount rate (3% vs 7%), key benefit assumptions, and cost uncertainty; state recommendation with caveat on distributional impacts)",
