ed); community detection: Louvain algorithm, modularity Q; structural holes: Burt's brokerage — bridge between otherwise unconnected clusters; homophily: tendency to connect with similar others; tie strength: Granovetter's weak ties hypothesis — weak ties bridge communities, strong ties within communities; R igraph and Python NetworkX for implementation); digital trace data and survey experiments (observational trace data: Twitter/X API, Reddit API, web scraping (BeautifulSoup, Scrapy); ethical issues: informed consent, data de-identification, platform TOS; validity threats: platform selection bias, bot accounts, algorithmic curation; survey experiments: vignette experiments, conjoint analysis, list experiments for sensitive topics; MTurk vs Prolific vs Qualtrics panels; power analysis for survey experiments)",
