ality — identify the top 5 brokers and their real-world role; run community detection (Louvain) and describe the communities sociologically; test a hypothesis about network structure: does homophily on ideology predict tie formation? Use logistic regression with node attributes as predictors; discuss structural holes and brokerage opportunities in the network; conclude with a claim about what network position means for information diffusion or power)",
