e; economic vs environmental); predict or measure audience response using Kahan's cultural cognition framework — which worldview groups are most affected by each frame?; propose a trusted messenger strategy — which communicator identity reduces identity-protective cognition for your target audience?; evaluate the ethical limits of strategic framing — when does tailored communication become manipulation?)",
