nce obligations do these create for multinational companies? Are they compatible with the GDPR's cross-border transfer framework?; propose a global data transfer compliance architecture for a specific company profile), or a U.S. federal privacy law analysis (select one: apply FTC Section 5 to a data privacy or data security failure — what constitutes an unfair practice under the three-part test?; analyze a major FTC data privacy order (Facebook 2019, Twitter 2022, Amazon Ring, OpenAI); what remedies can the FTC impose? What limits does AMG Capital Management v FTC (2021) place on FTC data privacy enforcement?; compare CCPA/CPRA with GDPR — how do the right to opt-out of sale, right to limit use of sensitive personal information, and enforcement model differ from GDPR's consent-and-rights framework?; evaluate the case for a U.S. federal comprehensive privacy law — what would preemption of state laws mean for California? What are the tradeoffs between a rights-based (GDPR-style) and a harm-minimization (FTC-style) approach?; apply HIPAA breach notification to a specific incident — does the incident constitute a breach of unsecured PHI? Who must be notified, by when, and in what form?; analyze one state breach notification law divergence from the federal landscape)",
