mmission investigation (Google Shopping, Amazon, Meta); evaluate the ongoing tension between innovation incentives and monopolization liability; propose a doctrinal test), or a merger analysis (select one: apply the 2023 DOJ/FTC Merger Guidelines to a specific proposed merger — horizontal, vertical, or conglomerate; define the relevant market using the SSNIP test; apply the HHI screen; analyze unilateral effects (UPP test), coordinated effects, and entry/expansion; analyze the merger's vertical or conglomerate effects under the 2023 Guidelines' expanded framework; evaluate a recent blocked or challenged merger (US v Penguin Random House, FTC v Meta/Within, US v JetBlue/Spirit, or FTC v Amazon/MGM); EU merger analysis — apply the SIEC test and the EU's coordinated effects and non-coordinated effects framework; evaluate remedies proposed in one deal: were structural divestitures sufficient to restore competition?; discuss the debate over whether current merger enforcement is too lax or too aggressive for digital platform markets)",
