rated liquidity (Uniswap v3): LPs choose price ranges; higher capital efficiency; liquidity mining: protocols emit governance tokens to incentivize LPs (yield farming); DeFi yield: LP fees + liquidity mining rewards; TVL (total value locked); lending protocols (Aave, Compound): supply APY, borrow APY, utilization rate model; liquidation mechanics; stablecoins: algorithmic (Terra LUNA collapse 2022), collateralized (MakerDAO DAI), fiat-backed (USDC)); MEV and tokenomics (maximal extractable value (MEV): profit extractable by block producers via transaction ordering; types: arbitrage MEV (price discrepancy between AMMs), sandwich attacks (front-run + back-run a large trade), liquidation MEV (profitable liquidations); Flashbots: MEV-boost, PBS (proposer-builder separation); MEV redistribution mechanisms; tokenomics design: token utility (governance, fee payment, staking); token distribution (fair launch vs VC-backed, vesting schedules); velocity problem: tokens with purely transactional use have low value retention; governance token models: vote escrow (veTokenomics) — lock tokens for voting power; quadratic voting; Gini coefficient of token distribution; crypto market microstructure: bid-ask spread on CEXs; order book depth; wash trading; market manipulation; regulatory uncertainty)",
