cy, manipulation, regulatory gaps)? Evaluate the Neuromarketing Science and Business Association ethical guidelines; compare neural measures vs traditional self-report measures (consumer surveys, focus groups); evaluate the predictive validity literature (meta-analysis by Boksem-Smidts 2012); evaluate oxytocin and economic behavior — apply Zak's trust game results and the broader oxytocin and prosocial behavior literature (De Dreu 2012: oxytocin promotes in-group cooperation and out-group derogation): is oxytocin a 'moral molecule' or a parochialism molecule? Evaluate the replication crisis in social-neuroeconomics (oxytocin: small Ns, publication bias); what methodological improvements (pre-registration, within-subject designs, large samples) are needed?)",
